hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"441","Mujhe Yahya ne Malik se, unhon ne Yazeed bin Ruman se, unhon ne Salih bin Khawwat se, unhon ne us shakhs se jis ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Zaat-ur-Riqa ke din Salat-ul-Khauf padhi riwayat kya ke aik giroh Aap ke sath saf mein khada hua aur aik giroh dushman ke samne saf mein khada hua, phir Aap ne us giroh ke sath jo Aap ke sath tha aik rakat padhi phir khade saabit rahe aur unhon ne apne liye puri ki, phir laute aur dushman ke samne saf mein khade hue, aur dusra giroh aaya to Aap ne unhein wo rakat padhai jo Aap ki Namaz mein se baqi thi, phir baithe saabit rahe aur unhon ne apne liye puri ki, phir unhein salam phera."
"442","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Qasim bin Muhammad se, unhon ne Salih bin Khawwat se riwayat kya ke Sahl bin Abi Hathma ne un se bayan kya ke Salat-ul-Khauf ye hai ke Imam khada ho aur us ke sath us ke sahaba mein se aik giroh ho aur aik giroh dushman ke samne ho, phir Imam aik rakat ruku kare aur un ke sath jo us ke sath hain sajda kare, phir khada ho, phir jab seedha khada ho jaye to saabit rahe aur wo apne liye baqi rakat puri karein, phir salam pherein aur lautein jab ke Imam khada ho, phir wo dushman ke samne hon, phir dusre aain jo Namaz na padhe hon aur Imam ke peechhe takbeer kahein, phir wo unhein rakat ruku karae aur sajda kare, phir salam phere, phir wo khade hon aur apne liye baqi rakat ruku karein phir salam pherein."
"443","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar se jab Salat-ul-Khauf ke bare mein sawal kya jata to kehte ke Imam aur logon mein se aik giroh aage badhe aur Imam unhein aik rakat padhae, aur un mein se aik giroh us ke aur dushman ke darmiyan ho jo Namaz na padhe hon, phir jab jo us ke sath hain aik rakat padh lein to un ke peechhe hatein jo Namaz na padhe hon aur salam na pherein, aur jo Namaz na padhe hon wo aage badhein aur us ke sath aik rakat padhein, phir Imam laute jab ke us ne do rakat padh li hon, phir dono girohon mein se har aik khadi ho aur Imam ke lautne ke baad apne liye aik aik rakat padhe, phir dono girohon mein se har aik ne do rakat padh li hon, phir agar khauf is se zyada sakht ho to mard khade apne qadmon par ya sawaar qibla ki taraf munh karke ya qibla ki taraf munh kiye baghair Namaz padhein."
"444","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Saeed bin Musayyab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khandaq ke din Zuhr aur Asr na padhi yahan tak ke suraj ghuroob ho gaya. Malik ne kaha ke Qasim bin Muhammad ki Salih bin Khawwat se hadith Salat-ul-Khauf mein jo maine suni hai us mein sab se pasandida hai."
